217	  - [ ] `seed-b-backend.Api/Controllers/Dtos/UpdateCartItemQuantityRequest.cs` (NEU) — identisches Validierungsmuster wie `AddCartItemRequest.Quantity` (Story 3.1):
218	    ```csharp
219	    using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations;
220	
221	    namespace seed_b_backend.Api.Controllers.Dtos;
222	
223	    public class UpdateCartItemQuantityRequest
224	    {
225	        [Range(1, int.MaxValue)]
226	        public required int Quantity { get; set; }
227	    }
